              "message": "Merge pull request #1370 from ZIDAN44/fix/892-session-json-cap\n\nfix(engine): cap sessions at 256 MiB and parse them without a Value tree (#892)",
              "url": "https://github.com/Blenux/soundcraft/commit/73eeb692fe0804c1750ae6f53640c0533a008805",
