              "message": "Merge pull request #4367 from helenkwok/web/host-page\n\nfeat(web): page host mode, so a page can host WordCraft in its own document (#4366)",
              "url": "https://github.com/Blenux/wordcraft/commit/d4bbe8ba9aeafa5aeb4bf1fdfbc710a168b41352",
              "date": "2026-11-05T13:11:02Z"
